# ---------------------------------------------------------------- model weights
# Never commit weights. The 20B MXFP4 GGUF alone is 12 GB; models are pulled by
# the backend (`ollama pull ...`), which is what makes them replaceable.
*.gguf
*.safetensors
*.bin
*.pt
*.pth
*.onnx
/hf_cache/
/models/
/.ollama/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- runtime state
# The control plane keeps its database, evidence store, sandboxes, checkpoints
# and generated deliverables outside the tree, under SOVEREIGN_DATA_DIR
# (default ~/.sovereign). These patterns catch it if anyone repoints it inside.
#
# Every one of them is ANCHORED with a leading slash, and that matters: an
# unanchored `evidence/` matches at any depth, so it silently excluded the
# backend/sovereign/evidence/ source package and the first push produced a tree
# that imported fine locally and failed on a fresh clone. Runtime directories
# only ever appear at the repository root; never let these patterns roam.
/.sovereign/
/data/
/artifacts/
/workspaces/
/checkpoints/
/evidence/
/uploads/
/sovereign-workbench/data/
/sovereign-workbench/artifacts/
/sovereign-workbench/workspaces/
/sovereign-workbench/checkpoints/
/sovereign-workbench/uploads/

*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.venv/
venv/
env/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- logs & scratch
*.log
!corpus/**/*.log
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*~
.idea/
.vscode/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- secrets
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key
credentials.json
